     ButtonBox["SpinorChain", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/SpinorChain"]}], "SeeAlso"],
  Cell["Related Guides", "MoreAboutSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Formatting, Model Output and SPINAS Export",
